sieve-filter-v2
; Every note between `low` and `high`, as MIDI numbers (60 is middle C, C4), so a melody keeps to
; a comfortable register. Rests always pass.
id        melody-range
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     audio
symbols   notes*
describe  Every note between the lowest and highest allowed (MIDI numbers; 60 is middle C).
param     low   int  60  0  127  the lowest note (MIDI)
param     high  int  84  0  127  the highest note (MIDI)

states    1
start     0
accept    0
for d 0 {DURATIONS - 1}
  t 0 @{d} 0
  for p 1 {PITCHES}
    if {LOW + p - 1 >= low && LOW + p - 1 <= high}
      t 0 @{p * DURATIONS + d} 0
    fi
  done
done
end
